  digest=b3:44588e268766fd3f2ba7144e58a885442b00f14ab23c4c990896e67935e399e4 file=cortex/vector/vector.go range=554:594 lang=go exported=true byte_range=17792:19107
  sig=func (i *Index) Search(q []float32, k int) ([]Hit, error)
  doc=Search returns the up-to-k vertex IDs closest to q, ordered closest\nfirst. Tombstoned vertices are skipped. Returns ErrEmptyIndex if the\nindex has no entry point yet. Concurrent-safe with readers only.\nUses the VectorStore bound via BindStore to resolve neighbor vectors;\nreturns an error if no store is bound and the graph is non-empty.
